@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix ex: <http://ex/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
ex:Off a sh:NodeShape ; sh:deactivated true ; sh:targetClass ex:T ; sh:property [ sh:path ex:never ; sh:minCount 1 ] .
ex:On a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass ex:T ; sh:property [ sh:path ex:p ; sh:minCount 1 ] .
